bs, and jump high on bouncy trampolines. Then slide down twisty slides for an exciting ride. This VR game mixes nice looks with easy controls, giving a fun journey in a tricky place.", "short_description": "In \"Dott Swarmers,\" on Meta Quest AppLab, you play as a happy, shiny ball in a colorful forest. Move with your hands, bounce off walls for fun climbs, and jump high on bouncy trampolines. Then slide down twisty slides for an exciting ride. This VR game mixes nice looks with easy controls, giving a fun journey in a tricky place."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/dottswarmers/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Canyons Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/dottswarmers/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "8908334229192919"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75269157_8289384461089197_7354560866275120645_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QD_QrhDPQp0Q7kNvwGZ5BJm&_nc_oc=Adp5ZuEFFWFMcs-wMe0yIJsGYAl8lLxYkU_F9rft3QmPGEwS8dCTXG1mobCizGNgmIU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS4sfM4G_SJnLQAeBQFb5bl-BZgtzcyBGvfVJGjjaEkFw&oe=6B